{"id":"B1-L212","title":"Despite / although — production and review","cefr":"B1","level":"B1","unit":"B1-U13","focus":"Despite / although — produção e revisão","targets":{"grammar":"Despite / although — produção e revisão","pron":"Contrações e fala conectada (compreensão)","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["famous physicist","black hole","serious illness","science book","universe theory","wheelchair user","speech device","science legacy","bestselling author","time theory","brilliant mind","strong will","daily struggle","research career","science prize","space study","physics class","inspiring life"],"field":"Sentimentos e decisões","genre":"Biografia","skill":"Escrita","words_min":18},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 212 · Despite / although — production and review","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Despite / although — produção e revisão.","**Pronúncia:** Contrações e fala conectada (compreensão).","**18 palavras novas** (sentimentos e decisões).","**Texto do dia:** biografia."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (B1):** eu consigo produzir uma biografia com although, despite, in spite of e however."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **escrever frases claras e corretas (IELTS Writing, TOEFL Writing)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["famous physicist","físico famoso"],["black hole","buraco negro"],["serious illness","doença grave"],["science book","livro de ciência"],["universe theory","teoria do universo"],["wheelchair user","usuário de cadeira de rodas"],["speech device","aparelho de fala"],["science legacy","legado científico"],["bestselling author","autor best-seller"],["time theory","teoria do tempo"],["brilliant mind","mente brilhante"],["strong will","força de vontade"],["daily struggle","luta diária"],["research career","carreira de pesquisa"],["science prize","prêmio de ciência"],["space study","estudo do espaço"],["physics class","aula de física"],["inspiring life","vida inspiradora"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A short biography","blocks":[{"type":"bio","name":"Stephen Hawking","paras":["**Although** Stephen Hawking was diagnosed with a serious illness at 21, he lived and worked for decades. **Despite** losing his voice, he wrote bestselling books. **In spite of** his limits, he traveled and gave talks.","His life shows that, **however** hard things seem, it is **worth continuing**."],"years":"1942–2018","facts":[["Job","físico"],["Country","Inglaterra"],["Famous for","buracos negros"]],"gloss":[["illness","doença"],["black hole","buraco negro"],["limit","limite"],["talk","palestra"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Hawking was diagnosed at 21.","ans":"T","why":"at 21."},{"q":"He stopped working after the diagnosis.","ans":"F","why":"worked for decades."},{"q":"He wrote bestselling books.","ans":"T","why":"bestselling books."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“diagnose” = ?","opts":["diagnosticar","diagnóstico só","dignar"],"ans":0,"why":"diagnose."},{"q":"“bestselling” = ?","opts":["mais vendido","melhor vendedor","vendável"],"ans":0,"why":"bestselling."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Contrastes numa biografia","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Conector","Exemplo"],"rows":[["although","**Although he was ill, he worked.**"],["despite + -ing","**Despite losing his voice, he wrote.**"],["in spite of + subst.","**In spite of his limits, he traveled.**"],["however","**However hard it seems,…**"]],"cap":"Contrastes numa biografia"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**However + adjetivo** = por mais… que: *however hard it seems*."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"___ he was ill, he worked. (Although)","a":"Although","why":"+ oração."},{"s":"___ losing his voice, he wrote. (Despite)","a":"Despite","why":"+ -ing."},{"s":"___ of his limits, he traveled. (In spite)","a":"In spite","why":"in spite of."},{"s":"However ___ things seem,… (hard)","a":"hard","why":"however + adj."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["famous physicist","físico famoso"],["black hole","buraco negro"],["serious illness","doença grave"],["science book","livro de ciência"],["universe theory","teoria do universo"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["he","traveled","In","spite","of","his","limits"],"ans":"In spite of his limits he traveled","pt":"Apesar dos limites, viajou."},{"words":["books","Despite","losing","his","voice","he","wrote"],"ans":"Despite losing his voice he wrote books","pt":"Apesar de perder a voz, escreveu livros."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"famous physicist","pos":"word","pt":"físico famoso","ex":"Famous physicist.","expt":"Físico famoso."},{"w":"black hole","pos":"word","pt":"buraco negro","ex":"Black hole.","expt":"Buraco negro."},{"w":"serious illness","pos":"word","pt":"doença grave","ex":"Serious illness.","expt":"Doença grave."},{"w":"science book","pos":"word","pt":"livro de ciência","ex":"Science book.","expt":"Livro de ciência."},{"w":"universe theory","pos":"word","pt":"teoria do universo","ex":"Universe theory.","expt":"Teoria do universo."},{"w":"wheelchair user","pos":"word","pt":"usuário de cadeira de rodas","ex":"Wheelchair user.","expt":"Usuário de cadeira de rodas."},{"w":"speech device","pos":"word","pt":"aparelho de fala","ex":"Speech device.","expt":"Aparelho de fala."},{"w":"science legacy","pos":"word","pt":"legado científico","ex":"Science legacy.","expt":"Legado científico."},{"w":"bestselling author","pos":"word","pt":"autor best-seller","ex":"Bestselling author.","expt":"Autor best-seller."},{"w":"time theory","pos":"word","pt":"teoria do tempo","ex":"Time theory.","expt":"Teoria do tempo."},{"w":"brilliant mind","pos":"word","pt":"mente brilhante","ex":"Brilliant mind.","expt":"Mente brilhante."},{"w":"strong will","pos":"word","pt":"força de vontade","ex":"Strong will.","expt":"Força de vontade."},{"w":"daily struggle","pos":"word","pt":"luta diária","ex":"Daily struggle.","expt":"Luta diária."},{"w":"research career","pos":"word","pt":"carreira de pesquisa","ex":"Research career.","expt":"Carreira de pesquisa."},{"w":"science prize","pos":"word","pt":"prêmio de ciência","ex":"Science prize.","expt":"Prêmio de ciência."},{"w":"space study","pos":"word","pt":"estudo do espaço","ex":"Space study.","expt":"Estudo do espaço."},{"w":"physics class","pos":"word","pt":"aula de física","ex":"Physics class.","expt":"Aula de física."},{"w":"inspiring life","pos":"word","pt":"vida inspiradora","ex":"Inspiring life.","expt":"Vida inspiradora."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Mind over matter.** — A mente sobre a matéria.","**Beat the odds.** — Vencer as dificuldades.","**The sky is the limit.** — O céu é o limite.","**Never lose hope.** — Nunca perca a esperança.","**Despite losing his voice, he wrote books.** — Apesar de perder a voz, escreveu livros.","**In spite of his limits, he traveled.** — Apesar dos limites, viajou.","**Although he was ill, he worked for decades.** — Embora doente, trabalhou por décadas.","**Wear and tear.** — Desgaste."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"diagnose","pt":"diagnosticar","forms":[["I / you / we / they diagnose","Doctors diagnose illness."],["he / she / it diagnoses","Médicos diagnosticam doenças."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Biography","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Biography","lines":[["Ana","Although he was ill, he worked for decades.","Embora doente, trabalhou por décadas."],["Leo","Despite losing his voice, he wrote books.","Apesar de perder a voz, escreveu livros."],["Ana","In spite of his limits, he traveled.","Apesar dos limites, viajou."],["Leo","However hard things seem, it is worth continuing.","Por mais difícil que pareça, vale continuar."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Contrações e fala conectada (compreensão)","items":[{"label":"Contrações e fala conectada (compreensão)","note":"Reconheça: I’ve → /aɪv/, she’s → /ʃiz/, wouldn’t’ve, whaddaya (what do you), gonna, wanna.","words":["I’ve been there.","She’s been studying.","What do you want?","I’d’ve gone."]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Use although.","pt":"Use.","model":"Although he was ill, he worked."},{"q":"Use despite + -ing.","pt":"Use.","model":"Despite being tired, she ran."},{"q":"Use however + adjective.","pt":"Use.","model":"However hard it is, I’ll try."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 6-line biography using contrast connectors.","model":"Although Stephen Hawking was diagnosed with a serious illness at 21, he worked for decades. Despite losing his voice, he wrote bestselling books. In spite of his limits, he traveled and gave talks. However hard things seemed, he continued. His life shows it is worth continuing. He inspires many.","checklist":["Usei **although/despite/in spite of**","Usei **however + adj.**","Biografia curta"],"words":"6 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “famous physicist” mean?","opts":["buraco negro","físico famoso","livro de ciência"],"ans":1,"why":"**famous physicist** = físico famoso."},{"q":"What does “black hole” mean?","opts":["doença grave","teoria do universo","buraco negro"],"ans":2,"why":"**black hole** = buraco negro."},{"q":"What does “serious illness” mean?","opts":["doença grave","livro de ciência","usuário de cadeira de rodas"],"ans":0,"why":"**serious illness** = doença grave."},{"q":"What does “science book” mean?","opts":["teoria do universo","livro de ciência","aparelho de fala"],"ans":1,"why":"**science book** = livro de ciência."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}